-- statement:
--   **The block constants by doubling.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegKs1`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.KR.sp_kg (s : IState HS) (F : Fin HS → List ℤ) {pk b j n Bk : ℕ}
--       (hX : F vX = []) (hY : F vY = []) (hCN : F CN = []) (hc : F kc = [2 ^ pk])
--       (hB : F kB = [2 ^ b]) (hK : F kK = [(j : ℤ)]) (hJ : F kJ = [((b * (2 * n) : ℕ) : ℤ)])
--       (hpk : pk < b) (hnj : 2 * n ≤ 2 ^ j) (hBk : b * 2 ^ j + 2 ≤ Bk)
--       (hBm : 2 * (b * (2 * n)) + 2 ≤ Bk) (hBj : zsz (j : ℤ) ≤ Bk) :
--       Sp kgRS (encK s F) (encK s (Function.update (Function.update F kK [KFV.kG b (2 * n) (2 ^ pk)])
--         kJ [(2 ^ b) ^ (2 * (2 * n))])) (cKG j (b * (2 * n)) Bk)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** B3′, part 1: computing the Kronecker constants of a block in the kernel
--
--   `kgRS` (with `j` on `kK`, `m = b·2n` on `kJ`, `2^pk` on `kc`, `2^b` on `kB`, scratch `vX, vY, CN`):
--   `acc := 2^pk`, `ρ := 2^b`; `j` times `acc := acc + acc·ρ`, `ρ := ρ·ρ` (so `acc = KFV.kG b 2^k 2^pk`,
--   `ρ = 2^(b 2^k)`); then `kJ := 2^m`, `kK := acc mod 2^m = KFV.kG b (2n) 2^pk`, `kJ := 2^m · 2^m`.
--   Cost `O(j · b 2^j + pow2Cost m)` — linear in `n b` up to the factor `j = clog₂ 2n`.
